=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  accounts found -----------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. Item 3's screen: carol has an empty$
# password, george and alice have passwords that never expire,$
# alice, deploy and backup-operator have no login in 90 days.$
# Each row is the command to run; hardn changes nothing.$
$
# Account Review ###############################################$
$
  Empty password -----------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] carol                Run passwd -l carol$
$
  Password never expires ---------------------------------------$
$
   -  george               Run chage -M 365 george$
   -  alice                Run chage -M 365 alice$
$
  No login in 90 days ------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] alice                2026-03-02, run usermod -e 1 alice$
  [ ] deploy               Never, run usermod -e 1 deploy$
  [ ] backup-operator$
      2025-11-20, run usermod -e 1 backup-operator$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0 or q]:$
$
$

